    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab6a1bbebd544.71240981\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">There is a new survey on the Battle.net Launcher for WoW: Forever, and players can give Blizzard their opinions on a few select topics! Depending on the size of the window players make their launcher, it may be difficult to notice at first - you'll find it slightly down the Forever launcher page.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303182.jpg\" id=\"1303182\"><img width=\"700\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303182.jpg?maxWidth=700\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"New Survey\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.29733 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a></div><br><br>We can't share the survey's contents since Blizzard asks participants not to forward it to others, post the link online, share screenshots on social media, or stream images of it. That said, while it initially seemed like this survey appeared open to all players, many have reported not seeing it on their launchers, so double-check and share your thoughts on the potential future of WoW: Forever if you’re able.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>There is a new survey on the Battle.net Launcher for WoW: Forever, and players can give Blizzard their opinions on a few select topics! Depending on the size of the window players make their launcher, it may be difficult to notice at first - you'll find it slightly down the Forever launcher page.<br /><br />We can't share the survey's contents since Blizzard asks participants not to forward it to others, post the link online, share screenshots on social media, or stream images of it. That said, while it initially seemed like this survey appeared open to all players, many have reported not seeing it on their launchers, so double-check and share your thoughts on the potential future of WoW: Forever if you’re able.</noscript>            \n        ",
